Offline compiler patch for server/compiler/utils/util.ts

fetchRemoteFile reads the captured CDN index named by SPC_ASSETS_INDEX and
refuses other URLs. Missing Git edit dates use SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH, supplied
from the pinned commit, instead of the current clock. Source enumeration is
sorted before compilation so derived series and statistics are reproducible.

Re-record this patch whenever UTIL_TS_SHA256 stops matching, and bump
BUILDER_VERSION in pin.env. Never fall back to a live fetch or wall clock.

